# Tables

## restaurants
- id: uuid, primary key

- merchant_id: uuid | no foreign_key, belongs to merchant table in users_db.

- name: string
- phone_number: string
- is_open: boolean
- rating: float
- is_active: boolean
- country: string
- city: string
- district: string
- neighborhood: string
- postal_code: string
- address_line1: string
- address_line2: string
- created_at: timestamp

## categories
- id: integer, primary key

- restaurant_id: uuid, foreign key to restaurants.id

- name: string
- is_active: boolean
- created_at: timestamp

## items
- id: integer, primary key

- category_id: integer, foreign key to categories.id

- name: string
- description: string
- price: float
- is_active: boolean
- created_at: timestamp